load @term/seed/number/real
  find real

# The irrational numbers, the reals that are not fractions, the gaps the rationals fail to fill. The square root of two,
# pi, and the golden ratio are irrational: their decimal expansions never repeat. They are what completeness adds to the
# rationals, the dense uncountable remainder that makes the real line continuous. The form carries the reals they live
# among.
form irrational
  link reals, like real
